        <activityName xml:lang="en">Door, inner, aluminium, transparent filling, total</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Door, inner, aluminium, transparent filling, total
The measures of the visible door sheet are 0.9m x 2.0m. The bill of materials is based on data from 4 aluminium system houses. The disposal was estimated based on the bill of materials.;
UUID: 45a0b3b5-7aed-3239-ace1-79558e0a7b2b
Included are the supply of inner aluminium doors with transparent filling at regional storage and the disposal at the end of life.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Bill of materials. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_45a0b3b5-7aed-3239-ace1-79558e0a7b2b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
